---
layout: base.njk
title: Privacy
permalink: /privacy/index.html
---
<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-24 relative">
  <!-- Decorative Background Elements -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-primary-container rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-30 animate-blob"></div>
  <div class="absolute -top-10 -left-10 w-72 h-72 bg-tertiary-container rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-30 animate-blob animation-delay-2000"></div>

  <div class="relative bg-surface-container-low p-10 md:p-14 rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-outline-variant/10 scrapbook-rotate-1">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-primary-fixed rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-on-primary-fixed shadow-md -rotate-3">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">shield_person</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-headline text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-primary">{{ privacySettings.page_title | default("Privacy & Trust") }}</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-primary max-w-none text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body text-justify">
      {% if privacySettings.body %}
      <div class="privacy-content-wrapper">
        {{ privacySettings.body | markdownToHtml | safe }}
      </div>
      {% else %}
      <p class="font-medium text-primary-dim text-xl mb-10">Your creative journey is safe with us. We believe in total transparency about how our website works.</p>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-highest p-8 rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-tertiary shadow-sm transition-transform hover:scale-[1.01]">
          <h3 class="font-headline font-black text-tertiary mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">mail_lock</span>
            Secure Messaging
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm">When you send an inquiry or join our community, your messages are securely routed directly to our inbox. We do not sell or store this data on a public database—it goes straight to our team to help you.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-surface-container-highest p-8 rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-secondary shadow-sm transition-transform hover:scale-[1.01]">
          <h3 class="font-headline font-black text-secondary mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">shopping_cart_checkout</span>
            Your Shopping Cart
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm">We don't use tracking cookies to follow you across the internet. Instead, your shopping cart is saved securely and locally on your own device. Your cart belongs to you.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-surface-container-highest p-8 rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-primary shadow-sm transition-transform hover:scale-[1.01] md:col-span-2">
          <h3 class="font-headline font-black text-primary mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">payments</span>
            Payments & Security
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm">We process orders manually to ensure a personal touch. We will never ask for your private PINs or passwords on this site. Your security is our priority.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm opacity-40 italic mt-12 text-center">Update this policy in your shop settings.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .privacy-content-wrapper p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .privacy-content-wrapper strong {
    color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  /* Ensuring justified text looks good on mobile */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .text-justify {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>

<style>
  @keyframes blob {
    0% { transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1); }
    33% { transform: translate(30px, -50px) scale(1.1); }
    66% { transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.9); }
    100% { transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1); }
  }
  .animate-blob {
    animation: blob 7s infinite;
  }
  .animation-delay-2000 {
    animation-delay: 2s;
  }
</style>
